  {
    num: "5072"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Chilli-rubbed Kangaroo Salad\"\n  servings: 7\n  prep_time: \"22 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"32 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"1 pieces cumquat\"\n    \"3 oz watermelon\"\n    \"2 cups starfruit\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"Baked lavender flowers-stuffed lamb, seasoned with pimento and rich herbs, accompanied by roasted sweet potato medley.\"\n    \"A robust delicious stew featuring Inuit flavors, loaded with creamy meat, rich vegetables, and a zesty, salty broth.\"\n    \"Our fluffy quail, slow-cooked to perfection, accompanied by steamed cornichons and a rich, savory gravy.\"\n    \"Grilled quail kebabs, marinated in Bangladeshi spices and served with a fresh red cabbage and loquat salad.\"\n    \"A succulent goose steak, encased in a crunchy turmeric crust, served with a side of cayenne pepper mashed beans.\"\n    \"Three jasmine rice with zucchini, sweet potato, kohlrabi, jicama and sage. With a side of baked loquat, and your choice of raspberry or chinese cabbage.\"\n    \"A succulent ostrich steak, encased in a savory herbes de provence crust, served with a side of cardamom mashed spinach.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 262\n    protein: \"10g\"\n    carbs: \"50g\"\n    fat: \"6g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
