    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Tamisium ara voluptates caute suppono deludo ante.\"\n  slug: \"crinis-clementia-testimonium\"\n  author: {\n    name: \"Georgette Hermann\"\n    avatar: \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8427471\"\n    bio: \"toothpick advocate, film lover\"\n  }\n  date: \"2026-04-07\"\n  tags: [\n    \"wear\"\n    \"flu\"\n    \"possession\"\n  ]\n\n  published: false\n  reading_time: \"16 min\"\n  summary: \"Utique capio sufficio alo corrigo accedo acervus clam comitatus. Quisquam decumbo teneo suadeo vigor deprecator viscus vehemens tamdiu tenetur. Thema tenus vicinus vigilo doloribus coepi deduco amiculum.\"\n}"
