    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Cloves-rubbed Quail Salad\"\n  servings: 6\n  prep_time: \"19 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"19 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"4 tbsp rice paper\"\n    \"4 pieces buckwheat noodles\"\n    \"3 pieces chickory\"\n    \"3 tbsp oregano\"\n    \"3 lbs whiting wild rice\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"An exquisite kohlrabi dish, paired with custard apples and a hint of lime leaves.\"\n    \"45-day aged lamb steak, with choice of 3 sides.\"\n    \"Fresh vegetable oil with a pinch of vanilla, topped by a caramelized papaw with whipped cream\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 540\n    protein: \"8g\"\n    carbs: \"52g\"\n    fat: \"8g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "5280"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Sushi\"\n  servings: 6\n  prep_time: \"40 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"37 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"2 oz mangosteens\"\n    \"1 pieces sake\"\n    \"2 tsp extra virgin olive oil\"\n    \"2 oz blue swimmer crab\"\n    \"4 oz oranges\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"Crispy fried goose bites, seasoned with ajwan seed and served with a tangy bush tomato dipping sauce.\"\n    \"Fresh mixed greens tossed with curry-rubbed rabbit, turnips, and a light dressing.\"\n    \"A moist lettuce creation, seasoned with curry and chervil, showcasing the best of plant-based cuisine.\"\n    \"A classic pie filled with delicious pork and golden vanilla beans, baked in a spicy pastry crust and topped with a golden-brown lattice.\"\n    \"Baked cashews-stuffed duck, seasoned with galangal and fresh herbs, accompanied by roasted swiss chard medley.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 728\n    protein: \"45g\"\n    carbs: \"41g\"\n    fat: \"39g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "5281"
    title: "SQL Queries"
    description: "Database queries stored as raw strings."
    shapeIndex: 4
    mamlText: "# Database query definitions\n{\n  name: \"user-reports\"\n  version: 1\n\n  queries: {\n    # Find all active users\n    find_active: \"\"\"\nSELECT u.id, u.name, u.email\nFROM users u\nWHERE u.active = true\n  AND u.created_at > '2024-01-01'\nORDER BY u.name\n\"\"\"\n\n    # Monthly aggregation\n    monthly_stats: \"\"\"\nSELECT\n  DATE_TRUNC('month', created_at) AS month,\n  COUNT(*) AS total,\n  SUM(amount) AS revenue\nFROM orders\nGROUP BY month\nORDER BY month DESC\n\"\"\"\n  }\n}"
  }
