  {
    num: "5477"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Tomato-glazed Beef Skewers\"\n  servings: 5\n  prep_time: \"19 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"32 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"4 cups kudzu\"\n    \"4 pieces rose water\"\n    \"3 tbsp yellow papaw\"\n    \"1 oz loquats\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A simple date pie. No fancy stuff. Just pie.\"\n    \"Three cucumber with jerusalem artichoke, radicchio, green pepper, radicchio and banana. With a side of baked papaw, and your choice of tapioca flour or celery.\"\n    \"A special violet cloves from Christmas Island. To support the strong flavor it is sided with a tablespoon of garam masala.\"\n    \"A slow-roasted Herring Gull with a crunchy, rich exterior. Stuffed with honeydew melon and covered in olive sauce. Sides with snowpea sprouts puree and wild swiss chard.\"\n    \"Tender beef skewers, glazed with a sweet and tangy watermelon sauce, served over a bed of fragrant jasmine rice.\"\n    \"A robust juicy stew featuring Louisiana Creole flavors, loaded with tangy meat, salty vegetables, and a creamy, savory broth.\"\n    \"A robust spicy stew featuring Indian flavors, loaded with creamy meat, sour vegetables, and a juicy, spicy broth.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 651\n    protein: \"46g\"\n    carbs: \"80g\"\n    fat: \"8g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
