  {
    num: "5770"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Tender Prune And Endive Salad\"\n  servings: 8\n  prep_time: \"41 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"65 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"4 tsp potato flour\"\n    \"2 lbs yoghurt\"\n    \"4 lbs arrowroot\"\n    \"3 pieces cous cous\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A succulent emu steak, encased in a juicy orange zest crust, served with a side of rogan josh mashed radish.\"\n    \"A special white apple cider vinegar from Pitcairn Islands. To support the strong flavor it is sided with a tablespoon of tikka masala.\"\n    \"An exquisite red pepper dish, paired with parsnip and a hint of cardamom.\"\n    \"Hearty beans and crocodile stew, slow-cooked with paprika and cos lettuce for a comforting, flavorful meal.\"\n    \"A robust salty stew featuring Romani flavors, loaded with fresh meat, golden vegetables, and a crunchy, spicy broth.\"\n    \"Three vegetable spaghetti with cabbage, radish, red pepper, french eschallots and corn oil. With a side of baked blackberry, and your choice of chinese five spice or saffron.\"\n    \"A golden lettuce creation, seasoned with baharat and tandoori masala, showcasing the best of plant-based cuisine.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 508\n    protein: \"44g\"\n    carbs: \"82g\"\n    fat: \"35g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
